WEBVTT

00:04.421 --> 00:06.923
[intriguing music playing]

00:09.342 --> 00:12.762
[Caiman] 2,302 Ohba gyoza...

00:13.388 --> 00:16.850
2,303 Ohba gyoza...

00:17.392 --> 00:20.979
2,304 Ohba gyoza...

00:21.896 --> 00:23.106
[groans]

00:23.606 --> 00:25.859
It's no good, I can't sleep.

00:25.942 --> 00:28.695
- Counting gyoza isn't helping.
- [snoring]

00:28.778 --> 00:31.531
Only thing that it's doing
is making me more hungry.

00:31.614 --> 00:32.824
I'm gonna go for a walk.

00:35.201 --> 00:36.286
[sleepy moaning]

00:41.041 --> 00:42.709
[sighs] Huh?

00:42.792 --> 00:44.961
- [Dokuga] There's 100 nicks!
- [Tetsujo] Great job!

00:45.754 --> 00:49.174
With vending machines like this,
we can get spare change every night!

00:49.674 --> 00:51.718
More work after our part-time job.

00:51.801 --> 00:56.097
I would never have believed it.
So there are poor Sorcerers out there.

00:56.181 --> 00:58.224
Huh?! Cross-Eyes?!

00:58.308 --> 00:59.976
[suspenseful music playing]

01:00.060 --> 01:01.061
It is them!

01:02.812 --> 01:03.938
[Caiman gasps]

01:05.148 --> 01:06.524
Huh? What?

01:07.734 --> 01:10.528
- [dramatic music playing]
- [Tetsujo] And just who the hell are you?

01:13.114 --> 01:15.033
[Caiman] I... I am...

01:16.076 --> 01:18.661
I'm a friend of Risu.

01:20.497 --> 01:22.499
[frantic electronic music playing]

01:34.886 --> 01:36.387
[lyrics in Japanese]

02:47.500 --> 02:49.961
THE BEGINNING

02:51.045 --> 02:52.964
[Chota] Oh, En...

02:53.590 --> 02:54.549
Huh?

02:54.632 --> 02:57.510
[Shin] Hey. So I heard that En collapsed?

02:57.594 --> 03:00.096
[Chota] Oh! Shin! And Noi!

03:00.180 --> 03:03.766
Wait, aren't those two humans
from the Hole?

03:03.850 --> 03:06.227
- [Kasukabe] Hi! Hello there!
- [Jonson chitters]

03:06.728 --> 03:09.355
They're acquaintances of mine.
Overlook them, 'kay?

03:09.439 --> 03:10.940
- [Noi] Huh?
- [Chota] All right...

03:11.024 --> 03:12.483
Hey, where's Nikaido?

03:12.567 --> 03:17.155
Actually, up until now,
Nikaido was really me in disguise.

03:17.238 --> 03:18.239
You didn't notice?

03:18.323 --> 03:19.741
What?!

03:19.824 --> 03:24.370
As a matter of fact, Nikaido ran away
with that creepy lizard face guy.

03:24.454 --> 03:26.372
I wonder where she is now?

03:26.456 --> 03:30.126
[Kasukabe] I see, that's what happened.
You really did it, Caiman.

03:32.462 --> 03:34.464
[Chota] Ah! En's awake!

03:34.547 --> 03:36.633
- Boss! Are you okay?
- Boss!

03:36.716 --> 03:40.303
Oh, En! Thank goodness you're okay baby!

03:40.386 --> 03:41.930
- [En roars]
- [Chota squeals]

03:42.013 --> 03:44.432
- [En] Whoa! Chota!
- [Chota whimpering]

03:44.515 --> 03:45.683
[dramatic music playing]

03:51.522 --> 03:54.692
[Shin] Hey, En,
are you heading to Nikaido by any chance?

03:55.276 --> 03:58.488
[En] The contract inside of me
is guiding me to her.

03:58.571 --> 04:01.157
I'm going to kill the lizard guy myself.

04:01.658 --> 04:03.826
Make sure you're not too far behind!

04:10.500 --> 04:11.334
[music fades]

04:11.417 --> 04:13.836
[Natsuki snoring]

04:16.965 --> 04:17.966
[Nikaido] Caiman?

04:20.385 --> 04:21.344
[Fujita] Hey!

04:21.427 --> 04:24.138
Ebisu, you in here?

04:24.222 --> 04:25.598
[eerie music playing]

04:30.603 --> 04:31.437
Ebi...

04:32.105 --> 04:33.189
[choked snarling]

04:33.273 --> 04:34.440
Oh!

04:37.026 --> 04:38.027
[Fujita] Ebisu...

04:38.528 --> 04:40.071
Fujita.

04:40.154 --> 04:41.739
- Ebisu!
- [Ebisu gasps]

04:41.823 --> 04:43.992
- [dramatic music playing]
- [Fujita] Ebisu!

04:44.075 --> 04:45.368
[Ebisu moans softly]

04:46.202 --> 04:47.620
- [Fujita gasps]
- [body thuds]

04:47.704 --> 04:49.372
[Fujita] Ebi... Ebisu!

04:49.455 --> 04:51.332
- [doppelgänger snarling]
- [Fujita gasps]

04:51.416 --> 04:53.251
[crazed laughter]

04:53.334 --> 04:55.169
[screams] Oh no!

04:55.253 --> 04:56.879
[whimpering]

04:59.424 --> 05:00.466
[grunts]

05:01.467 --> 05:02.635
[doppelgänger snarling]

05:02.719 --> 05:04.095
[Ebisu whimpering weakly]

05:04.595 --> 05:05.847
[Fujita gasps]

05:06.347 --> 05:09.017
[doppelgänger grunting painfully]

05:11.394 --> 05:14.272
Damn monster! Ebisu, hold on!

05:14.355 --> 05:17.025
It's okay, Noi will fix you up in no time!

05:17.859 --> 05:19.485
[screaming]

05:22.613 --> 05:25.408
[screaming, whimpering]

05:27.785 --> 05:29.704
[demonic laughter]

05:29.787 --> 05:33.207
No. It's no good.
My magic won't work! [whimpers fearfully]

05:33.291 --> 05:35.960
[screaming]

05:38.046 --> 05:39.130
[breathes heavily]

05:39.213 --> 05:40.965
Is that black powder?

05:42.675 --> 05:44.093
[grunts, screams]

05:44.177 --> 05:45.636
[soundscape muffles]

05:47.430 --> 05:48.598
[silence]

05:50.850 --> 05:52.935
[Dokuga] You say you're Risu's friend?

05:53.519 --> 05:55.855
Could it be that you're Aikawa?

05:55.938 --> 05:58.358
Ai... Kawa?

06:01.194 --> 06:02.278
[all gasp]

06:06.574 --> 06:08.409
[Caiman] What the hell is that?

06:08.493 --> 06:10.244
[Ushishimada] Dokuga, Tetsujo!

06:10.328 --> 06:12.497
It's not good. En has found us!

06:12.580 --> 06:15.875
- Damn it, has he come here for us?
- No! Our part time jobs!

06:15.958 --> 06:18.378
Who gives a shit about that? Come on!

06:19.128 --> 06:20.797
Dokuga! Hey, what are you doing?

06:20.880 --> 06:22.131
- Let's go!
- Yeah.

06:22.215 --> 06:23.466
What is it?

06:23.549 --> 06:27.345
I don't know. Something about that guy.
He seemed familiar somehow.

06:27.428 --> 06:29.138
[dramatic music playing]

06:32.975 --> 06:34.894
What's going on? What's happening?

06:34.977 --> 06:37.355
Caiman, Nikaido, where are you?!

06:37.438 --> 06:39.649
[Nikaido breathing heavily]

06:41.984 --> 06:43.611
[Caiman] Nikaido!

06:44.487 --> 06:45.613
Caiman...

06:45.696 --> 06:47.782
[grunts] Nikaido! What's wrong?

06:47.865 --> 06:49.784
My chest... the pain...

06:50.284 --> 06:52.328
I can feel him. En is nearby.

06:52.995 --> 06:56.165
Okay, come on, I'll carry you.
Let's get out of here!

06:56.249 --> 06:58.126
[all panting]

06:58.209 --> 07:00.253
[all screaming]

07:03.339 --> 07:04.173
[Caiman] Yah!

07:08.761 --> 07:09.846
[grunts]

07:11.055 --> 07:12.306
[yelling fearfully]

07:14.350 --> 07:15.685
[yelling]

07:17.395 --> 07:18.813
- [gasps]
- [music fades]

07:18.896 --> 07:21.315
- [rocks clattering]
- [Caiman gasps]

07:22.900 --> 07:24.026
[uneasy music playing]

07:24.110 --> 07:26.571
[En] It's been a while, Nikaido.

07:26.654 --> 07:27.780
En.

07:28.406 --> 07:31.701
And your friend...
You're the famous Lizard guy?

07:32.201 --> 07:34.579
Well I've come here
to get my partner back.

07:35.163 --> 07:37.957
- [Caiman] Ha! Well you got good timing.
- Caiman!

07:38.040 --> 07:41.210
'Cause I was just thinking
how running away isn't my style.

07:41.294 --> 07:44.213
I'm gonna kill you, you mushroom freak!

07:44.297 --> 07:47.300
Nikaido's contract
will die along with you,

07:47.383 --> 07:49.469
and she'll finally be free of your ass!

07:50.219 --> 07:54.098
Bring it. I'll mess you up so bad,
you won't come back a second time.

07:54.182 --> 07:57.977
It doesn't matter how much
of an amazing Sorcerer you think you are,

07:58.060 --> 08:02.523
because Magic doesn't work on me!

08:02.607 --> 08:03.983
[exhales slowly]

08:04.066 --> 08:07.111
- [Caiman grunting]
- [suspenseful music playing]

08:07.195 --> 08:08.362
[straining]

08:09.238 --> 08:12.200
[grunting]

08:19.457 --> 08:21.876
What? Is that it?

08:21.959 --> 08:23.044
[Caiman growls]

08:23.127 --> 08:24.754
[En] You seem to be under the impression

08:24.837 --> 08:27.632
that my mushrooms
are just some trivial Magic.

08:27.715 --> 08:30.885
You have no idea
how terrifying it really is.

08:31.761 --> 08:33.804
As vengeance for Matsumura,

08:34.388 --> 08:37.308
I'm going to kill you
in the most agonizing way possible.

08:37.391 --> 08:39.727
[Caiman] Go ahead and try! [grunts]

08:40.228 --> 08:41.646
[blowing]

08:44.482 --> 08:46.025
Although it's true,

08:46.108 --> 08:49.654
seems my Magic has no impact
on your flesh. However...

08:52.114 --> 08:56.202
Even though I can't cast my Magic
directly on you as an attack,

08:56.285 --> 08:58.788
I can still release
tiny spores in the air.

08:58.871 --> 09:01.123
What the hell are you talking about?

09:01.207 --> 09:02.959
Shut up and fight me already!

09:03.042 --> 09:04.961
[En] It's over.

09:05.044 --> 09:06.003
What?

09:06.087 --> 09:10.967
[En] Those spores I was telling you about?
They're invading your body as we speak.

09:11.050 --> 09:13.302
Going further and further in.

09:13.803 --> 09:15.596
[gasps] Caiman!

09:15.680 --> 09:17.682
And then, they break out.

09:18.182 --> 09:19.475
[pained yell]

09:22.562 --> 09:23.563
[music ends]

09:30.861 --> 09:31.988
[Fujita] Don't worry.

09:32.989 --> 09:35.992
I managed to take down that monster
with my Magic.

09:36.492 --> 09:37.493
It's all right.

09:38.744 --> 09:41.289
I'll beg En to use Kikurage's Magic.

09:41.372 --> 09:43.708
The pain will all go away soon,
you'll see.

09:44.208 --> 09:46.377
Trust me, the next time you wake up,

09:47.086 --> 09:49.213
you won't hurt anymore.

09:49.297 --> 09:50.381
I promise.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.892
[Shin] Huh?

10:01.976 --> 10:04.979
Well, there it is.
Looks like En's gone and done it again.

10:05.062 --> 10:06.397
[Noi] What a pain!

10:06.480 --> 10:07.898
[uneasy music playing]

10:07.982 --> 10:10.651
[Caiman splutters]

10:10.735 --> 10:11.861
[Nikaido grunts]

10:12.445 --> 10:14.322
[intriguing music playing]

10:17.742 --> 10:20.411
[Nikaido gasps, groans painfully]

10:21.454 --> 10:23.539
[En] You really shouldn't be so reckless.

10:23.623 --> 10:25.249
If you damage those mushrooms,

10:25.333 --> 10:27.793
it will be the same
as damaging your own leg.

10:28.502 --> 10:32.965
Although, even though the contract
hasn't fully reintegrated with you yet,

10:33.049 --> 10:35.551
I'm surprised
you still managed to attack me.

10:36.427 --> 10:38.763
Is he really that important to you?

10:38.846 --> 10:42.058
Yeah, he is. He's my friend.

10:42.600 --> 10:45.186
He's the most important
and precious person to me.

10:45.269 --> 10:46.187
[En gasps]

10:46.270 --> 10:47.563
You're open!

10:47.647 --> 10:48.939
[En yells painfully]

10:53.194 --> 10:54.111
Caiman?

10:54.195 --> 10:57.615
[groans softly] Crap...
That really hurts, you know.

10:57.698 --> 11:01.118
How dare you grow mushrooms in my body?
Now I'm really pissed off!

11:04.455 --> 11:05.539
[En gasping]

11:05.623 --> 11:07.875
Time to...

11:08.959 --> 11:10.878
die!

11:11.754 --> 11:13.756
- [Caiman yelling]
- [Nikaido] Caiman!

11:17.093 --> 11:19.261
Oh wow, your face...

11:20.721 --> 11:22.890
[pained yelling]

11:28.104 --> 11:29.021
Caiman...

11:32.733 --> 11:34.777
Cai...man...

11:41.117 --> 11:43.911
I really wanna eat

11:44.787 --> 11:45.871
gyoza...

11:52.253 --> 11:57.007
Your death is not on me
because you were killed by somebody else.

12:01.929 --> 12:03.305
[music fades]

12:03.389 --> 12:04.765
[solemn music playing]

12:05.391 --> 12:08.394
FAREWELL, CAIMAN

12:10.438 --> 12:11.564
[Nikaido] Caiman...

12:12.648 --> 12:15.526
So that was your real face I saw,
wasn't it?

12:17.069 --> 12:19.405
You finally returned to your former self.

12:21.407 --> 12:24.827
Do you remember yesterday's promise?

12:26.495 --> 12:28.581
Let's return to the Hole together.

12:31.292 --> 12:33.210
Okay, Caiman?

12:36.088 --> 12:40.551
Oh boy... En told me I had to go
and collect that Lizard guy's corpse,

12:40.634 --> 12:41.969
just in case, but

12:42.803 --> 12:45.055
how am I supposed to find him in all this?

12:45.556 --> 12:47.183
[Kasukabe] There's no way...

12:47.266 --> 12:48.392
Can it be?

12:48.476 --> 12:51.145
Caiman, did you really
get yourself killed?

12:51.645 --> 12:53.981
- [Shin] Hey, Kasukabe!
- [gasps]

12:54.064 --> 12:55.941
Take a look at this.

12:56.817 --> 12:59.320
- [Kasukabe] Whoa...
- [Jonson] Shocking!

12:59.403 --> 13:02.907
[Shin] If he fell into this magma,
there's no way we're recovering his body.

13:02.990 --> 13:04.366
- What's that?
- Huh?

13:05.409 --> 13:08.162
[Kasukabe] Is that Caiman's... head?!

13:13.959 --> 13:14.960
BURNING HEART

13:15.044 --> 13:17.379
[moaning, grunts]

13:22.009 --> 13:24.261
[Ushishimada] It looks like
En isn't following us.

13:24.345 --> 13:25.429
[Tetsujo] That's good.

13:25.513 --> 13:29.391
Still, we should probably hang out here
a little while longer, just in case.

13:30.518 --> 13:32.269
Dokuga? What's up?

13:33.646 --> 13:35.773
I was just thinking about the boss.

13:38.859 --> 13:39.860
[Tetsujo] Me too.

13:40.361 --> 13:42.363
I've been thinking about it a lot.

13:42.863 --> 13:44.532
I don't know if I told you guys.

13:44.615 --> 13:47.743
There was a time when the boss and I went,
just the two of us,

13:47.827 --> 13:50.704
to a bar in Dung Hill
where elite Sorcerers hung out.

13:51.831 --> 13:55.459
And the guy who ran the place,
he was sitting at the back of the bar.

13:55.960 --> 13:59.004
When he looked at the boss, he fainted!

13:59.088 --> 14:01.298
- [all chuckling]
- [Ushishimada] Hang on, hang on.

14:01.382 --> 14:04.802
If we're sharing stories like this,
then I've got a good one8 too.

14:06.178 --> 14:08.597
[Ton] We all know
how greedy the boss was with food,

14:08.681 --> 14:10.933
but he was kind enough
to give me a hamburger.

14:11.016 --> 14:13.769
[Ushishimada] Only because
you had a hungry look in your eyes.

14:13.853 --> 14:16.564
- You're such a greedy bastard!
- [Ton chuckling]

14:16.647 --> 14:17.565
Hey, Dokuga?

14:18.315 --> 14:21.777
I was thinking about the day
we met the boss for the first time.

14:23.779 --> 14:26.240
When we were young
and had no real purpose.

14:26.740 --> 14:29.535
We were just trying to survive
in any way possible.

14:30.870 --> 14:33.122
We used to question
our worth in this world

14:33.914 --> 14:35.583
because we couldn't use Magic.

14:35.666 --> 14:38.544
We had to steal food
just to survive daily.

14:40.421 --> 14:43.716
- [Sorcerer 1] You little brats!
- [Sorcerer 2] How should we kill them?

14:44.425 --> 14:48.012
[pained gasping] What the hell is wrong
with this guy's spit?

14:48.095 --> 14:50.222
[Sorcerer 1] I'll cut your mouth out
for doing that!

14:50.306 --> 14:52.266
- [Tetsujo] Leave him alone!
- [Sorcerer 1 grunts]

14:52.349 --> 14:53.309
[Ton] Tetsujo!

14:53.392 --> 14:56.520
[Ushishimada] You damn Sorcerers!
What the hell do you think you're doing?

14:56.604 --> 15:01.025
[Sorcerer 2] Hey, I've decided
how I'm going to execute these brats.

15:01.108 --> 15:04.028
Let's throw them all in the Hole.

15:05.613 --> 15:07.531
[all whimpering]

15:07.615 --> 15:09.783
- [Dokuga giggling]
- [all] Huh?

15:09.867 --> 15:11.660
- [giggling]
- Dokuga?

15:11.744 --> 15:13.370
This pain that we're feeling,

15:14.371 --> 15:17.082
it's proof that we have Sorcerer blood.

15:17.166 --> 15:19.919
The blood inside us
is rejecting the Hole's rain.

15:20.002 --> 15:22.546
It's proof that we are really Sorcerers.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.214
- What?
- Yeah.

15:24.298 --> 15:27.843
- Yeah, that's it. You're totally right!
- [Cross-Eyes laughing]

15:27.927 --> 15:29.929
[Sorcerer 1] The hell's wrong with them?

15:30.012 --> 15:32.181
[pained grunt, spluttering]

15:36.268 --> 15:38.228
[Dokuga] The boss
took down those Sorcerers

15:38.312 --> 15:39.730
and then went through the Door.

15:41.357 --> 15:44.568
And as though we were drawn to him,
we followed him in.

15:46.320 --> 15:50.157
After that,
more and more people like us joined,

15:50.783 --> 15:52.743
and so the organization grew.

15:53.577 --> 15:55.496
Where is he now? I wonder.

15:56.789 --> 15:58.999
- [Natsuki] Big bro! You out here?
- [all] Huh?

15:59.083 --> 16:03.504
Caiman, Nikaido! Come on, where are you?

16:22.398 --> 16:23.857
[gasps] Who's there!?

16:23.941 --> 16:25.442
[uneasy music playing]

16:30.072 --> 16:31.907
[Risu gasps, whimpers fearfully]

16:33.784 --> 16:34.785
[screams]

16:34.868 --> 16:36.537
Why are you...

16:38.622 --> 16:40.290
You're... me?

16:40.916 --> 16:42.793
[pained yelling]

16:45.921 --> 16:48.298
[grunting, panting]

16:48.382 --> 16:51.051
[pained yelling]

17:04.148 --> 17:07.067
- [Ushishimada] Well, what's your name?
- Natsuki!

17:08.610 --> 17:11.113
I traveled here with Caiman,
the guy who looks like a lizard?

17:11.196 --> 17:13.323
- We came to see the boss together!
- Huh?

17:13.824 --> 17:15.826
[Saji] Caiman? Never heard of him.

17:15.909 --> 17:17.327
Oh, right.

17:17.911 --> 17:21.081
I guess since he didn't know the location
to the secret hideout,

17:21.165 --> 17:25.335
and the crosses on his eyes had gone,
then he must have been an imposter.

17:25.419 --> 17:28.255
Still, I can't help
but feel worried about him.

17:28.338 --> 17:30.340
- I wonder what happened?
- [Ton screams]

17:30.424 --> 17:31.341
[Natsuki gasps]

17:31.425 --> 17:32.593
[Tetsujo] What is it?

17:32.676 --> 17:33.844
[whimpers] There!

17:33.927 --> 17:36.180
- [flies buzzing]
- [ominous music playing]

17:36.263 --> 17:38.390
My name is Curse,

17:38.474 --> 17:41.477
and I am the most sinister being
in this realm.

17:42.144 --> 17:46.106
Do not look at me.
Do not even dare speak my name.

17:46.190 --> 17:47.483
[gasping]

17:48.108 --> 17:50.986
- [Tetsujo] Who do you think you are?!
- [Dokuga gasps] Stop!

17:51.070 --> 17:52.738
[Tetsujo] Get out of here, you freak!

17:53.572 --> 17:55.866
[Curse growling]

17:55.949 --> 17:57.409
[Tetsujo grunts, gasps]

17:57.493 --> 17:59.661
- [Curse snarling]
- [pained yelling]

18:00.245 --> 18:01.330
- [gasps]
- Tetsujo!

18:01.413 --> 18:02.706
Ton! Wait!

18:04.166 --> 18:06.210
- [Ton gasps]
- [Curse yells]

18:06.293 --> 18:09.254
- [pained grunt]
- Don't do anything. We can't fight him!

18:09.338 --> 18:13.217
We can't even think about attacking him.
If we do, we're dead!

18:14.343 --> 18:16.261
[Tetsujo and Ton groan painfully]

18:21.100 --> 18:22.518
[chains rattling]

18:26.688 --> 18:30.859
My name is Curse.
I am the one who takes away everything.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.444
[music fades]

18:37.866 --> 18:40.869
[grunting, labored breathing]

18:40.953 --> 18:45.374
My powers are weak
since I was turned back into a Sorcerer.

18:46.125 --> 18:50.420
I couldn't save Nikaido.
I could only bring him with me to safety.

18:50.504 --> 18:52.422
Looks like he's not breathing,

18:52.506 --> 18:56.510
and his body is really cold...

19:01.014 --> 19:02.808
[bubbling]

19:02.891 --> 19:05.352
MEMORY BUBBLES

19:08.480 --> 19:09.898
[footsteps echoing]

19:11.191 --> 19:12.401
- [door opens]
- Huh?

19:17.364 --> 19:18.574
[Caiman] Ugh, I'm home.

19:18.657 --> 19:20.909
Welcome back. So you've returned, huh?

19:20.993 --> 19:23.453
[Caiman] Yeah. It's fine though.

19:23.537 --> 19:25.289
I still don't remember who I was,

19:25.372 --> 19:28.167
but honestly,
it's probably for the best anyway.

19:29.835 --> 19:30.919
I see.

19:31.003 --> 19:32.921
[loud thud]

19:33.505 --> 19:35.549
First things first, let's have a drink.

19:35.632 --> 19:38.427
- And some gyoza!
- Yeah, I know!

19:43.807 --> 19:44.933
[Caiman] Nikaido?

19:45.017 --> 19:46.935
[fan creaking eerily]

19:48.270 --> 19:49.813
[Caiman] Let me help you out.

19:53.025 --> 19:54.443
Nikaido?

19:54.526 --> 19:55.652
[uneasy music playing]

19:56.320 --> 19:58.864
[Nikaido] Caiman. Why?

20:00.532 --> 20:01.658
[Caiman] Nikai...

20:03.577 --> 20:04.703
What?!

20:05.621 --> 20:07.039
[shocked gasping]

20:07.122 --> 20:08.457
[uneasy music building]

20:12.044 --> 20:13.462
[loud thud]

20:14.296 --> 20:15.714
[loud thud]

20:21.553 --> 20:23.263
[eerie music playing]

20:23.347 --> 20:24.723
[wet grunting]

20:43.075 --> 20:43.992
[wet spluttering]

20:44.493 --> 20:46.411
[footsteps echoing]

20:47.120 --> 20:48.121
[wet grunting]

21:02.010 --> 21:03.053
[gasps]

21:11.144 --> 21:13.647
- [liquid squelching]
- [intriguing music playing]

21:22.656 --> 21:24.658
I just had a horrible dream.

21:25.951 --> 21:28.578
In the dream, I killed someone.

21:29.204 --> 21:31.540
Someone special to me.

21:33.292 --> 21:35.877
This isn't the first time
this has happened.

21:36.378 --> 21:38.797
[headless man squelching wetly]

21:39.881 --> 21:41.049
What did you say?

21:42.342 --> 21:44.303
What is my... my name?

21:47.848 --> 21:49.308
What was it again?

21:51.018 --> 21:53.979
Take this. I'm sure it'll come in handy.

21:54.479 --> 21:55.564
Now hurry!

21:55.647 --> 21:57.566
[sizzling]

21:57.649 --> 21:59.359
[headless man chittering]

22:00.277 --> 22:03.530
What's that? He decided to leave?

22:04.031 --> 22:06.825
He has changed
because he had been here for a long time?

22:10.412 --> 22:11.246
Stop it!

22:11.330 --> 22:13.457
I found out something amazing!

22:13.540 --> 22:15.959
- [Aikawa] Risu!
- Although, nothing's confirmed yet.

22:16.043 --> 22:17.544
[Aikawa] Don't do it!

22:27.554 --> 22:29.723
[Kai] A way to manipulate time.

22:29.806 --> 22:31.975
[footsteps approaching]

22:35.854 --> 22:39.608
Please just let me die.
Just let it be over.

22:41.568 --> 22:42.611
[headless man grunting]

22:43.445 --> 22:44.571
[music fades]

22:48.950 --> 22:50.952
[Japanese theme song playing]

24:16.705 --> 24:17.914
THE END

24:17.998 --> 24:19.875
[narrator] What we learned in Episode 18.

24:19.958 --> 24:22.627
Caiman finally comes face to face
with the remaining Cross-Eyes.

24:22.711 --> 24:24.212
Ebisu is quite the delinquent.

24:24.296 --> 24:26.590
The Cross-Eyes' boss
is an imposing figure.

24:26.673 --> 24:31.052
What we're going to learn in Episode 19,
it's still lost in chaos.

24:31.136 --> 24:32.929
This is Dorohedoro!
